    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/a5c19611fd09fd9a4c80cb787f456ce1.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br> <br>Rat Trap is a 2D hand-drawn action adventure about a lab rat trying to escape its captivity. <i>What havoc could a rat cause if it came across a mech suit...?</i><br><br>Featuring high-speed gameplay, dastardly puzzles and multiple playable mech parts with unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/330815cd3b363e9fe04ce5382a720bad.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Fuse parts together to create powerful and unique combinations.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/5012449b6109b57910c718780d8095f8.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Split your mech apart to explore separately &amp; to solve puzzles.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4b0038ee8d9c56e9f6684aa04ac98c7a.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Instantly swap between characters with the press of a button.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you escape the Rat Trap?</h2>Explore a mysterious facility as you search for secrets and powerups to take on your captors, as well as an impending alien threat!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 unique characters, totalling 15 different playable combinations<br></li><li>Secrets galore! Use collectables to upgrade your robo-mech as you see fit<br></li><li>Use your fuse &amp; split powers to solve perplexing puzzles<br></li><li>Traverse a sprawling map, with optional accessibility features like NavAssist &amp; Memory Markers to keep you on track!<br></li><li>High speed gameplay with a  destructive mech suit!<br></li><li><strong>Optional </strong>challenge rooms and sequence-breaking tricks for experienced players</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/3263adbde6e2a7a8062cc08192581bba.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=352 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/a5c19611fd09fd9a4c80cb787f456ce1.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br> <br>Rat Trap is a 2D hand-drawn action adventure about a lab rat trying to escape its captivity. <i>What havoc could a rat cause if it came across a mech suit...?</i><br><br>Featuring high-speed gameplay, dastardly puzzles and multiple playable mech parts with unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/330815cd3b363e9fe04ce5382a720bad.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/21a5e75b76ca64133b0a1944356493d1.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Fuse parts together to create powerful and unique combinations.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/5012449b6109b57910c718780d8095f8.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/0de23db7dd2804e5b67f804517770fbe.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Split your mech apart to explore separately &amp; to solve puzzles.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4b0038ee8d9c56e9f6684aa04ac98c7a.webp?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.poster.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.webm?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/4814d1d047d1a8912e7a4ecf3b2fda55.mp4?t=1755124458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Instantly swap between characters with the press of a button.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you escape the Rat Trap?</h2>Explore a mysterious facility as you search for secrets and powerups to take on your captors, as well as an impending alien threat!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 unique characters, totalling 15 different playable combinations<br></li><li>Secrets galore! Use collectables to upgrade your robo-mech as you see fit<br></li><li>Use your fuse &amp; split powers to solve perplexing puzzles<br></li><li>Traverse a sprawling map, with optional accessibility features like NavAssist &amp; Memory Markers to keep you on track!<br></li><li>High speed gameplay with a  destructive mech suit!<br></li><li><strong>Optional </strong>challenge rooms and sequence-breaking tricks for experienced players</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723000/extras/3263adbde6e2a7a8062cc08192581bba.avif?t=1755124458\" width=616 height=352 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Fuse, Split and Swap to escape! A fast paced, hand-drawn action-adventure involving a rambunctious rat and its multiple mech parts that you can fuse together or split apart at will. Use these powers to explore a mysterious facility, solve puzzles and beat the bad guys! Can you escape the Rat Trap?",
